{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46124","headline":"对雪寄新定冯使君二首 二 · 贯休","name":"对雪寄新定冯使君二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"政化由来通上灵，丰年祥瑞满窗明。\n气严坐久灯凝焰，片大更深屋作声。\n飘掩烟霞何处去，欹斜杉竹向帘倾。\n雪林中客虽无事，还有新诗半夜成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}